      "side": 0,
      "message": "I\u0027m trying to figure out if there\u0027s a case where IsSdkVariant is false, but c.AlwaysSdk() is true, and so this change will expose an inconsistency. So far, ndk_* module factories do set this to true.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/ndk_prebuilt.go;l\u003d78;drc\u003dmaster\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/ndk_prebuilt.go;l\u003d130;drc\u003dmaster\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/ndk_prebuilt.go;l\u003d149;drc\u003dmaster\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/ndk_prebuilt.go;l\u003d130;drc\u003dmaster\n\nand these module factories don\u0027t seem to be mark their modules as IsSdkVariant either.",
      "parentUuid": "8e1fda0d_aa345cc5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3386,
